  "description": "Sends the morning intent prompt to all managers at 8:30am ET on weekdays. Prompts managers to declare their leadership focus for the day (delegation, strategic work, team support, etc.). The response is stored as a morning_intent ManagerPulse record and compared to evening actuals by computeEveningActuals.",
